{"ref":"BDB, חֶ֫בֶר²","hw":"חֶ֫בֶר²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֶ֫בֶר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵ֫בֶר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶבֶר</span> (𝔊 Χαβερ) the Kenite, husband of Jael <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:11\" href=\"/Judges.4.11\">Ju 4:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:17\" href=\"/Judges.4.17\">17</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:21\" href=\"/Judges.4.21\">21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:24\" href=\"/Judges.5.24\">5:24</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  a man of Asher <span dir=\"rtl\">חִבֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:17\" href=\"/Genesis.46.17\">Gn 46:17</a> (P) 𝔊 Χοβωρ <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:31\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.31\">1 Ch 7:31</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:32\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.32\">32</a> 𝔊 Χαβερ 𝔊L Ιεχοβερ; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵבֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:45\" href=\"/Numbers.26.45\">Nu 26:45</a> 𝔊 Χοβερ; on poss. identif. with <em>Ḫabiri</em> of Tel el Amarna v. Jastr<sup> JBL 1892, xi. 118 ff. 1893, xii. 61 ff.</sup><br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶבֶר</span> name in Judah <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.18\">1 Ch 4:18</a> 𝔊 Αβεισα, 𝔊L Αβερ.<br><strong>4.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">חָ֑בֶר</span> a Benjamite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.17\">1 Ch 8:17</a> 𝔊 Αβαρ, 𝔊L Αβερ.","next":"BDB, חֶבְרִי","prev":"BDB, חֶ֫בֶר"}